is knight on e5 instead. [%cal Gd7e5] }) (6... a6 { Just as good: the a pawn covers b5 first. [%cal Ga6b5] } 7. Bd3 c5 { About level: the pawn break arrives one move later. [%csl Gc5] }) 0-1


